sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant App as Travel App API
    participant RAG as RAG Pipeline
    participant KB as Internal Flight Knowledge Base
    participant LLM as Language Model

    Customer->>App: Ask about a flight
    App->>RAG: Send user question

    RAG->>KB: Find relevant flight data (semantic/vector search)
    KB-->>RAG: Return best matching context

    RAG->>LLM: Send question + retrieved context
    LLM-->>RAG: Generate grounded answer

    RAG-->>App: Structured flight result
    App-->>Customer: Accurate response (or no content if not found)
